"viewpoint a child of frozen habit".

Almost every great breakthrough in any field is the
result of thawing such a frozen mindset.

Not that my siggie "innovation" is any such "great
breakthrough", of course, but it is such a
"thawing".

I'm otherwise just speaking metaphorically.

