Initfadas, lifetimes spent doing boring labor in a
detested job, English cooking, and the other great
ills to which humanity is prey.

Failure to keep _any_ habits leads to utter chaos.

Somewhere in between is a point of optimal balance.

I seriously doubt that "signing articles only at
